'''Manic King Dragon''' (大狂乱のネコキングドラゴン, ''Dai Kyōran no Neko Kingu Doragon'', '''Insane King Dragon Cat''') is a [[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless]] enemy introduced in [[Draconian (Deadly)|Lizard Maniac]]. He was added in [[Version 5.0 Update|Version 5.0]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Manic King Dragon
|image = E 249.png
|appearance = [[Draconian (Deadly)|Lizard Maniac]]
[[Infernal Tower/Floor 36|Infernal Tower - Floor 36]]
|money drop = 1,350¢ - 5,332¢
}}

==Enemy==
It has even more range than its [[Crazed Lizard Cat (Enemy)|Crazed Counterpart]], more damage and has more health. It is protected by highly buffed [[Otta-smack-u]]s in its [[Draconian (Deadly)|Debut Stage]] making it significantly harder to reach.

==Strategy==
This enemy has somewhat low health for its damage output, so it's recommended to bring [[:Category:Wave Attack Cats|Wave attackers]] or [[:Category:Sniper-class Cats|snipers]] such as [[Crazed Gross Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Manic Macho Legs]] or [[Nerd Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Cyberpunk]]. Just make sure that you can keep the Otta-smack-us from getting too close! [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut]] can also be used to deal heavy damage on the Manic Dragons, while the [[Otta-smack-u]]s are not on the battlefield, so you should try your best to eliminate them before more could stack and cause trouble.

